  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Ma tribe’s main tent he requests to challenge Song tribe and raise army prestige. Ma Shang Feng hesitates between him and Cheng Hu. Both are rank four; Fei Sheng cultivates wood path and was taken in after Ma tribe annexed Fei tribe. He is newly subjugated and eager to show loyalty. Cheng Hu is sent first; Fei Sheng still shouts to be sent and later goes to the battlefield against a Song tribe expert.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "fac_song_tribe",
        "char_ma_shang_feng",
        "char_cheng_hu",
        "fac_fei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ma Shang Feng calls Fei Sheng Cheng for the second battle after Cheng Hu falters. Narration names him a fierce general who was ostracised in Fei tribe, used by Ma tribe as an insider during Fei tribe’s internal strife, then highly regarded after submitting. Sun Shi Han says that since the Imperial Court contest he has killed eight rank four experts, and that in an earlier battle he used numbness Gu and fought three experts of the same realm alone. He duels Pan Ping to a deadlock, each guarding against the other’s trump Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        538
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
